  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4857918aa396e664da4bf6e1e0405844, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level2(2-2)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - '"How were you introduced to comics? Did you already know a lot about them, or
    did you become interested in them while staying here...?"'
  - "There is a physical comics exhibit down the hall from here!\r\nSome of the museum
    staff bring me booklets and flyers from other rooms, so I can see what\u2019s
    going on.\r\n"
  - "They taught me how to use the digital archives, but I\u2019m not allowed to
    stay on there for too long."
  - "(I think they\u2019re worried that looking at screens too much would be worse
    for me than a regular person, which makes sense.)"
  - "The stuff from before the 1930s doesn\u2019t really resonate with me\u2013\r\nI
    think that\u2019s kind of strange, because most of these lamps over here are
    from that time period."
  - "Maybe it\u2019s because the first few things they brought me were about how
    detective comics became more popular, starting around\u2026 1935, maybe? Or 1937\u2013something
    like that.\r\n"
  responses:
  - responseText: Stands Out?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5ae659d7a1e562742ab3646df90b6e77, type: 2}
    responseChange: 0
  - responseText: Why Comics?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d3ee6a3bd749794584e174cfeb6be99, type: 2}
    responseChange: 0
